hadiths[8]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1041","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke Hazrat Umar ne jahiliyat mein e'tikaf ki nazr mani. To unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha to Aap ne unhen Islam mein e'tikaf ka hukm diya."
"1042","[AI-translation] Urwah bin Uzainah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main apni ek dadi ke sath nikla jin par Baitullah ki taraf paidal chalne ki nazr thi, yahan tak ke jab woh raste ke ek hisse mein thak gain, to main ne Abdullah bin Umar se poocha, to Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Unhen kaho ke sawar hon phir paidal chalen, phir jahan aajiz aa jaen. Malik ne kaha: Aur un par hadi hai."
"1043","[AI-translation] Tawus se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Abu Isra'il ke paas se guzre jabke woh dhoop mein khada tha, to Aap ne farmaya: 'Ise kya hai?' Unhon ne kaha: Us ne nazr mani hai ke na sae mein jaega, na baithega, na kisi se baat karega aur roza rakhega. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use sae ikhtiyar karne, baithne aur logon se baat karne aur apna roza poora karne ka hukm diya, aur use kaffare ka hukm nahin diya."
"1044","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo Allah ki ita'at ki nazr mane to use Allah ki ita'at karni chahiye, aur jo Allah ki nafarmani ki nazr mane to use nafarmani nahin karni chahiye.'"
"1045","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Allah ki nafarmani mein nazr nahin, aur na us mein jo ibn Adam ke ikhtiyar mein nahin.'"
"1046","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Allah ki nafarmani mein nazr nahin aur na us mein jo ibn Adam ke ikhtiyar mein nahin.'"
"1047","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ansar ki ek aurat qaid ho gai, jabke oontni is se pahle pakdi ja chuki thi. Shafi'i ne kaha: Goya un ki murad Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki oontni hai kyunke hadees ka aakhri hissa is par dalalat karta hai. Imran bin Husain ne kaha: Woh aurat un mein thi aur woh un ke paas oont late, phir ek raat woh bandhan se nikal bhagi aur oonton ke paas aai, woh jis oont ke paas jati aur use hath lagati to woh awaz nikalta, to woh use chhor deti, yahan tak ke woh us oontni ke paas aai aur use hath lagaya to us ne awaz na nikali aur woh ek mazboot oontni thi. To woh us ki pusht par baith gai phir use hankara to woh chal padi. Us raat use talash kiya gaya magar us par qabu na paya ja saka. To us ne Allah ke liye apne upar nazr mani ke agar Allah ne use is par nijaat di to woh use zibah karegi. Jab woh Madinah pahunchi to unhon ne oontni ko pahchan liya aur kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki oontni hai. To us ne kaha: Us ne Allah ke liye apne upar nazr mani hai ke agar Allah ne use is par nijaat di to woh use zibah karegi. To unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Tum use zibah na karna yahan tak ke ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko khabar den. Phir woh Aap ke paas aae aur Aap ko khabar di ke falan aurat Aap ki oontni par aai hai, aur us ne Allah ke liye apne upar nazr mani hai ke agar Allah ne use is par nijaat di to woh use zibah karegi. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Subhanallah! Us ne bura badla diya ke Allah ne use is par nijaat di to woh use zibah karegi? Allah ki nafarmani mein nazr poori karna nahin, aur na us nazr ko poora karna hai jo bande ya ibn Adam ke ikhtiyar mein nahin.'"
"1048","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain se riwayat hai ke ek qaum ne hamla kiya to unhon ne Ansar ki ek aurat aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki oontni ko pakad liya. Aurat aur oontni un ke paas thin, phir aurat nikal bhagi aur oontni par sawar ho kar Madinah aa gai, to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki oontni pahchani gai. To us ne kaha: Main ne nazr mani hai ke agar Allah ne mujhe is par nijaat di to main use zibah karungi. To unhon ne use zibah karne se roka yahan tak ke woh is ka zikr Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se karen. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Tum ne bura badla diya ke Allah ne tumhen is par nijaat di to tum use zibah karogi? Allah ki nafarmani mein nazr nahin aur na us mein jo ibn Adam ke ikhtiyar mein nahin.' Aur donon ne mil kar ya un mein se ek ne hadees mein kaha: Aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apni oontni le li."
